' ==================== Relationships ====================

' UC30: Admin Dashboard
AdminDashboard ..> AdminApi : uses
AdminApi ..> AdminRoutes : HTTP GET
AdminRoutes ..> AdminController : routes to
AdminController ..> OrderModel : aggregates
AdminController ..> UserModel : queries

' UC15 & UC17: Favorites
FavoritesContext ..> FavoritesApi : uses
FavoritesApi ..> UserRoutes : HTTP GET/POST/DELETE
UserRoutes ..> UserController : routes to
UserController ..> UserModel : updates favorites[]
UserController ..> LegoModel : populates

' UC32: User List
AdminUsersPage ..> AdminApi : uses (listUsers)
AdminApi ..> AdminRoutes : HTTP GET /users
AdminRoutes ..> AdminController : routes to (listUsers)

' UC33: User Detail
AdminUserDetailPage ..> AdminApi : uses (getUserDetail)
AdminApi ..> AdminRoutes : HTTP GET /users/:id
AdminRoutes ..> AdminController : routes to (getUserDetail)
AdminController ..> OrderModel : aggregates stats

' UC34: User Block/Unblock
AdminUsersPage ..> AdminApi : uses (updateUserStatus)
AdminUserDetailPage ..> AdminApi : uses (updateUserStatus)
AdminApi ..> AdminRoutes : HTTP PATCH /users/:id/status
AdminRoutes ..> AdminController : routes to (toggleUserStatus)
AdminController ..> UserModel : updates status/lockUntil

' Model relationships
UserModel "1" o-- "0..*" LegoModel : favorites

note right of AdminController
  **Key Methods:**
  - getOverviewStats: Aggregates 30-day revenue,
    order counts by status, user counts by status
  - listUsers: Applies filters (role, status, search),
    pagination, returns users + pagination metadata
  - getUserDetail: Fetches user + order stats
    (totalOrders, totalSpent, lastOrderAt)
  - toggleUserStatus: Locks/unlocks users,
    prevents self-modification
end note

note right of UserController
  **Favorites Logic:**
  - listFavorites: Populates User.favorites
    with full Lego documents
  - addFavorite: $addToSet to favorites array
  - removeFavorite: $pull from favorites array
  All return refreshed {favorites, favoriteIds}
end note

note bottom of UserModel
  **Key Fields:**
  - favorites: [ObjectId] ref 'Lego'
  - status: 'active' | 'inactive' | 'locked'
  - lockUntil: Date? (for temporary locks)
  - failedLoginAttempts: Number
end note

@enduml
